  "description": "Jeong Nana has spent a decade in the shadow of the world’s most famous superhero, Devil M. Now, their ten-year relationship is sinking under the weight of sheer relationship fatigue. Just as they seem ready to drift apart for good, a sinister love orb left behind by Devil M’s nemesis embeds itself inside Nana. What was meant to be a villain’s ultimate revenge suddenly triggers a bizarre shift in their dynamics, thrusting the weary couple into uncharted territory. With a dangerous magical force rewriting their connection, they must face the unexpected side effects before their love story comes to a permanent end.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Part of Peanutoon's Gosuwi BL Danpyeonseon (고수위 BL 단편선) Collection.*",
